OL,3,AMushroom murderer fails to overturn
OL,4,Aconvictions in Australian court
OL,5,Achallenge
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralia's mushroom killer has failed
OL,8,Fto overturn her murder convictions on
OL,9,Fappeal, with the court also ruling that
OL,10,Fshe never be released from prison.
OL,12,FErin Patterson, 52, was found guilty of
OL,13,Fmurdering three relatives and
OL,14,Fattempting to kill another when she
OL,15,Fserved them a toxic mushroom-laced meal
OL,16,Fin 2023. Her life sentence included a
OL,17,Fnon-parole period of 33 years.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
