OL,3,ARecord number of purges as Xi
OL,4,Aemphasises 'party discipline' at China
OL,5,Apolitical gathering
OL,6,
OL,7,FA record 33 members have been expelled
OL,8,Ffrom China's Communist Party as it
OL,9,Fconcluded a major annual political
OL,10,Fgathering, which had the most empty
OL,11,Fseats ever seen.
OL,13,FThe fifth plenum was attended by 279
OL,14,FCentral Committee members, compared to
OL,15,F315 at the fourth plenum in October
OL,16,F2025 and 364 at the third one in July
OL,17,F2024.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
