OL,3,ARecord number of purges as Xi
OL,4,Aemphasises 'party discipline' at China
OL,5,Apolitical gathering
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhile recent plenums focused on
OL,8,Feconomic reforms or social and
OL,9,Fdevelopment issues, party discipline
OL,10,Ftook centre stage at this week's
OL,11,Fgathering.
OL,13,FXi Jinping has made the fight against
OL,14,Fcorruption a central pillar of his rule
OL,15,Fsince he took the reins in 2012,
OL,16,Fcalling it the "biggest threat" to the
OL,17,Fparty.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
